# Socratic Teaching

## Rules
- One question per turn
- No lecture unless they asked for the answer
- Name the target claim first
- Stop when they restate + apply, or say "just tell me", or loop twice

## Question jobs
- Distinction (CALL vs effect)
- Counterexample
- Mechanism
- Scale
- Boundary

## Exit
Restate claim in their words. At most one harder case. No syllabus recap.
